#: model:ir.model.fields,help:portal_sale_distributor_event.field_event_event__portal_distributor_visible
msgid ""
"Technical field used by the access of the portal distributor group. With "
"website_event installed only the events published on the website are "
"visible, as it was in 19.0; without it, all of them."
msgstr ""
"Campo técnico que usa el permiso del grupo distribuidor del portal. Con "
"website_event instalado solo son visibles los eventos publicados en el sitio "
"web, como era en 19.0; sin él, todos."
